A||||10||MinnGreenGT||New Fiero seat covers from ExoticRebodies.com! Nice!||||14||
Z||000000||MinnGreenGT||12-10-2001||11:36 AM||||For those who have kitcars, or who may be interested in a "different" look. ExoticRebodies.com has begun producing a new Fiero seatcover, for a very reasonable price.  This is the email I recieved last week:<BR>------------------------------------<BR>Dear ExoticRebodies.com Registered Member:<P>Earlier today we received our prototype seat covers, which we had custom<BR>designed for the Pontiac Fiero, and I have to say, "WOW!"  Unlike any other<BR>seat cover on the market, our exclusive design has V shaped stitching,<BR>similar to what's found on Lamborghini Diablo seats!  And they are custom<BR>made to fit any year Pontiac Fiero!  <P>You can see these exciting seat covers by copying and pasting the following<BR>into your browser:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.exoticrebodies.com/fiero_seat_covers.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.exoticrebodies.com/fiero_seat_covers.htm</A> <P>If you like what you see you can order your pair online, using our secure<BR>server and your Visa or Master Card.  You'll benefit from placing your order<BR>now because of:  REDUCED PRICING, and; YOU GET TO PICK YOUR COLORS (YES, this<BR>includes 2 tone)!  Not all colors or color combinations will be stocked by<BR>Exotic Rebodies, Inc. so this is your best opportunity to get exactly the<BR>color or color combination you want at very reasonable pricing.<P>So check 'em out.  You'll be amazed at how good a stock Fiero seat can look!<P>Happy Holidays!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Joe<P>Joseph A. Zyskowski<BR>President, Exotic Rebodies, Inc. <A HREF="http://www.exoticrebodies.com" TARGET=_blank>www.exoticrebodies.com</A> <P>PS.  Please e-mail or call me at (702) 436-9252 if you would like to send<BR>your order in via regular mail.<BR>-------------------------------------<BR>Here are a few thumbnail images:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.exoticrebodies.com/images/25XS/redblackfq002_small.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.exoticrebodies.com/images/25XS/redblackfront001_small.jpg">   <IMG SRC="http://www.exoticrebodies.com/images/25XS/redblackback_small.jpg"> <P>Early order pricing of $220 solid colors, $240 2-Tone.  With standard pricing set at $280/$300. <P>Just thought I'd share!<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||mrfixit58||12-10-2001||12:58 PM||||Mr. Mike has nothing to worry about. It looks like a Walmart seat cover to me.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <P><B>JUST ADDED: </B>1988 GT w/ T-Tops, 5-Speed, and Performance Sound.||||reg||13
Z||000002||MinnGreenGT||12-10-2001||01:11 PM||||It certainly isn't a Mr.Mikes quality piece. It really is a "seat cover" -not a full reskin for the seats, and it's Leatherette, not real leather.  ...But then again, not everyone can afford Mr.Mikes stuff! I just figured it was another viable option for anyone who wanted a different look...||||reg||1
